{
  "slug": "swallow-insurance-rating-engine",
  "name": "Swallow Insurance Rating Engine",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build, validate, analyse, and test insurance rating models with the Swallow Rating Engine via MCP",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **2 agents** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `build-pricing-model` (Build a Swallow pricing engine configuration from a natural language description of an insurance product), `excel-to-swallow` (Convert an Excel rating workbook (.xls/.xlsx) into a Swallow pricing engine configuration), `swallow-docs` (Load the Swallow Pricing Engine documentation and JSON schema as reference context), `test-project` (Run a Swallow project's tests through the pricing engine and analyse results), `validate-project` (Validate an existing Swallow project configuration against the schema)\n- **Agents** (2): `swallow-actuary` (Insurance pricing specialist that builds, validates, and iterates on Swallow pricing models), `swallow-analyst` (Insurance pricing analyst that stress-tests models, maps pricing surfaces, identifies competitive positioning, and recommends commercial improvements)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `swallow`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install swallow-insurance-rating-engine@claude-community` from `llow-group/swallow-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "agent": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
